Add runtime confirmation test before provider privacy test. Need spirit that tracks speak calls. `guide([])` speak would be called if not blocked. We can create guide and spy:
```
const spirit = guide([]);
let calls=0; spirit.speak = async()=>{calls++; ...}
const {app}=await workshop(spirit, paidModel);
response /api/messages clarify expected 409 MODEL_COST_CONFIRMATION_REQUIRED; calls 0; project operations empty.
```
But `sendMessage` calls modelContext before speak, so confirmation throws. Good.
Need maybe project revision still 0. Add.

